From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 20:16:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] test(kanban): pin the owner_on_board probe's second replica
 query [daveey]

Post-merge check of PR #2415 (t_01a1d666580d271c): mutant C7, dropping the
second (LIMIT 1) replica query of the owner probe in
`_profile_board_cards` (`if owned & found or _present(...)` ->
`if owned & found:`), survived both chat-links test files. The only
owner_on_board test had the owner's carried sibling inside `mine`.

New case, parametrized on the two shapes `_ledger_index`'s profile-board
list carries outside `wanted`: the `work` owner's only card on the replica
is closed and released, or linked from another origin gateway's chat. The
missing `work` card must land in `only_in_ledger`, not `profile_board`,
and the diff must read unclean.

Proof (worker-1, hermes-core-wt test):
- GREEN at origin/main + this test: both files 31 passed, 0 failed, 0 skipped.
- RED under C7 alone: exactly the 2 new cases fail at
  `assert not report["clean"]` (clean True), 29 passed.

Test-only change.
---
 .../test_kanban_chat_links_profile_board.py   | 21 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 21 insertions(+)

diff --git a/tests/hermes_cli/test_kanban_chat_links_profile_board.py b/tests/hermes_cli/test_kanban_chat_links_profile_board.py
index 6a4b0cb2d4..ab90db4816 100644
--- a/tests/hermes_cli/test_kanban_chat_links_profile_board.py
+++ b/tests/hermes_cli/test_kanban_chat_links_profile_board.py
@@ -70,6 +70,27 @@ def test_links_diff_names_trusted_profile_board_rows_and_flags_a_missing_card_of
     assert "profile_board: 1 [('s1', ('hub', 'default', 't_d3e3f88a'))]" in capsys.readouterr().out
 
 
+@pytest.mark.parametrize("status, sibling", [
+    ("done", {"status": "done", "released": True, "unfinished": False}),  # closed: no longer an obligation
+    ("running", {"origin_gateway": "elsewhere"}),  # linked from another origin gateway's chat
+], ids=["closed", "other-origin"])
+def test_links_diff_flags_a_missing_card_whose_owners_only_carried_card_is_not_this_gateways_obligation(
+        kanban_home, monkeypatch, tmp_path, status, sibling):
+    """Post-merge check of PR #2415 (mutant C7): ``work``'s only card on the replica is a ledger card that is NOT
+    one of this gateway's open obligations, so only the owner probe's second replica query (same owner, outside
+    ``mine``) finds it. That still proves ``work``'s cards reach the Board: the missing one is a difference, never
+    a trusted profile-board row."""
+    rep = tmp_path / "default.db"
+    _replica(rep, [("t_work_on", "work card", status, OTHER)], [])
+    rows = [{**_profile_board_row("t_work_on", "s1", profile="work"), **sibling},
+            _profile_board_row("t_work_lost", "s1", profile="work")]
+    _diff_env(monkeypatch, kanban_home, rep, rows)
+    report = links.links_diff(ME, ksa.LISTED_STATUSES)
+    assert not report["clean"], report
+    assert report["only_in_ledger"] == {"s1": [(OTHER, "default", "t_work_lost")]}
+    assert report["profile_board"] == {} and report["profile_board_links"] == 0
+
+
